        "passage_type": "faithful_paraphrase",
        "text": "The study reports that PFOS and PFOA affinity to colloidal activated carbon increased as ionic strength rose from 1 to 100 mM and as Ca2+ increased from 0 to 2 mM, indicating promotive effects of higher salinity and divalent cations on adsorption."
