        "text": "Adding 1\u201320 mg C/L Suwannee River fulvic acid (representing dissolved organic carbon) or 10\u2013100 mg/L diethylene glycol butyl ether (AFFF surfactant) decreased PFOS and PFOA adsorption, showing inhibitory effects of natural organic matter and surfactants."
