        "section": "Main text excerpt (PubMed)",
        "passage_type": "faithful_paraphrase",
        "text": "The authors conclude that hydrophobic interaction is the predominant mechanism for PFAS adsorption to colloidal activated carbon and that hydrophilic, short\u2011chain PFAS (e.g., PFBA, PFPeA) will break through barriers first under identical conditions."
